// Scheduled Task Created With a Suspicious Action
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_schtasks_create_suspicious_action.yml (86b1ef0e-fac8-42b4-b001-5533b53aae8a)
// Level: medium. ATT&CK: T1053.005 Scheduled Task
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"1") and (process.executable:"*\\schtasks.exe" and process.command_line:"*/create*" and (process.command_line like~ ("*\\AppData\\*", "*\\Users\\Public\\*", "*\\ProgramData\\*", "*\\Temp\\*", "*powershell*", "*cmd /c*", "*cmd.exe /c*", "*mshta*", "*wscript*", "*cscript*")))
